#SKIPTEST
'Change1657 test: #option StringLimitCheck is only supported on PIC and AVR. This file has no
'real #chip (illustrative only - see the Expect note); on an unsupported target the option is
'ignored with a Warning, not an Error: "#option StringLimitCheck is not supported on this chip,
'and is ignored" (WarningStringLimitCheck). Marked #SKIPTEST since it needs a real non-PIC/AVR
'target to actually exercise, which this project does not otherwise test against.

#option StringLimitCheck
#option explicit

Dim Buf As String * 5
Do
Loop
